# File watching (D104), command jobs (D119-R2), wait (D101/D121). check only.
watch file "settings.json" and call it fileWatcher
watch folder "data" and call it folderWatcher
watch folder "data" recursively and call it deepWatcher
on change of fileWatcher
    say changed path change kind
.
on create in folderWatcher
    say changed file name
.
on delete in folderWatcher
    say changed path
.
on rename in deepWatcher
    say old path changed path
.
if fileWatcher is watching
    stop watching fileWatcher
.
start command "helper.ps1" and call it job
on output from job
    say received output
.
on error output from job
    say received error output
.
on exit of job
    say exit code of job state of job
.
on complete of job
    say output of job error output of job id of job
.
on cancel of job
    say "cancelled"
.
if job is running or job is completed or job is failed or job is cancelled
    cancel job
.
done is false
while not done
    wait 100 milliseconds
.
